{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act45side_level_act45side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act45side",
  "stageId": "act45side_05",
  "title": "通往舞会的邀请函",
  "storyCode": "SS-5",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8eecd4867e945f470fb7124f61edd69cf2404823465214d93176e64aa7148948",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g10_dreamcastlestage"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g9_warmrabbitnest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥，来，喝下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喉咙没有那么痛了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就好。这个给你，雷姆必拓到处都是沙尘，水袋和护目镜是必需的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子接过睦递来的物资，她的双手紧紧地攥着它们，鼓胀的水袋好像随时都要被挤破。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥，你有点奇怪。是不是不舒服？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，没什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "睦，你......还记得我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还记得我们经历过的那些事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我全都记得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子感觉自己终于变得冷静了些，她开始环顾四周——\n方才她们顺着狭长的矿道一直深入，最终来到了这里。\n这里阴暗潮湿，只有油灯和炉火提供着微弱的光亮。\n床与餐桌之间仅有一人宽的空隙，而从桌上水杯的数目来看，这里住着的绝不止睦一人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "睦，你在这里......已经生活多长时间了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一年，也许更久。在这里需要考虑的事很简单，时间的流逝也没有那么明显。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......你对时间没有任何感觉，是因为你身处在梦里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "睦，你为什么会做这样一个梦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梦......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "睦，我有重要的事和你说。这里不是现实，我们现在应该——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊呀——小睦，你怎么现在就回来啦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一个身影从身后跑了进来，径直将睦扑倒在柔软的小床上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈、妈妈，身上有灰，不要蹭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，都快一天没见了，让我抱抱怎么了嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有、有人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，小祥在这呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好久没来我们家了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "南小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，怎么这么见外啦，叫“南”就行啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我有时也会这么叫妈妈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "睦，你和南小姐的关系什么时候这么好了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们一直关系很好啊，毕竟是母女嘛~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小睦，今天的收获如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（翻找口袋）今天天气有点热，买黄瓜汁的人比平时多一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "睦小心翼翼地将手中的布袋打开，里面是一些零星的硬币。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯——小睦，你好棒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（翻翻口袋）喏，这是我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇......妈妈，好厉害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼哼，不知道为什么，今天找我修补衣服的人格外多哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你爸爸今天也很努力哦，在工地里忙活了一整天。我给他送午饭时，看他那副灰头土脸的样子实在不忍心，就特批他下工后去喝一小杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他现在啊——估计已经一大瓶啤酒下肚了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚好今天小祥来了，机会难得，不如我们请大家一起来吃饭吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家能聚在一起吃饭，好开心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是呀！而且今天收入不错，不多吃点怎么行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小祥千万别客气！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥，怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......没有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "眼前这个明显就不富裕的家，光秃秃的泥巴墙、微弱的油灯......\n为什么睦的梦里，会出现这些？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小睦，还有南......这位是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是我从小认识的朋友，祥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我来是想问问你们，要不要共进晚餐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我做了很多份，你们要是乐意的话，就一起来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这怎么好意思呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我听你们的邻居说，你们家的烟囱好像几天都没动静了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（摸摸肚子）唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，离上次聚会已经快一个月了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家都很想再听到小睦的演奏呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样的话......小睦，你是怎么想的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我......我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小祥肯定也很想听小睦的演奏吧？就算听了这么多次，还是百听不厌呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不介意的话，就在我们家办聚会吧！其实我们刚刚还在商量要请大家一起来吃饭呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥，你觉得呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我觉得......睦，由你自己来决定吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯，那我愿意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g9_warmrabbitnest"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "喧闹声，欢笑声，干杯声。\n不大的屋子里挤满了人，但大家好像并不在意空间的拮据。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来来来，再来一杯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这一杯，让我们欢迎小睦的朋友——祥子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "众人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦——祥子，你好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "大家一齐看向坐在角落的祥子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（举起酒杯）小祥......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "干、干杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "众人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "干杯——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "欢迎仪式过后，大家的注意力又重新回到了聚会本身。祥子独自靠在角落的墙上，眼神复杂地看着眼前的这一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "睦......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实......我全部都知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这一切都是假的，南会对我这么温柔，都是假的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这，这都是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以见到你的时候，我就知道，自己该回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，给我一个机会吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一个告别的机会，然后再结束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少在这里，我也想像你们一样，能自由地歌唱一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "睦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "没等祥子回应，睦抱着吉他，缓缓朝人群走去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小睦，你准备好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......大家好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么啦，小睦？有什么问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......椅子。我的椅子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给你准备好咯。喏，这个椅子，是你常用的那把吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "睦小心地打量着那把高脚椅，椅面上布满了深深的裂纹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，就是它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "睦缓缓坐下，所有人都跟着放轻了呼吸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "接下来，请聆听......\n《春日影》。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一生都无法忘记的旋律，在睦的梦境中再次被奏响。\n跟记忆里一样，此刻睦手中吉他的声音无比清澈悠扬，温暖着每一个人。\n眼前的若叶睦，却让祥子感到无比陌生。\n她已经不是那个不善于表达自己感情的睦了。\n虽然她还在努力尝试学会表达，但她在这里，似乎很幸福。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "睦，这也是你的愿望吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "今天她有无数次机会拉睦离开这里，而且她相信睦一定会跟她走。\n可她始终不忍这么做。\n因为现在的睦，看上去像是发自内心地感到幸福。\n人们随着音乐轻晃着身体，微弱的烛光将他们的影子映在了墙上，就像春日暖阳下摇曳的树影一般。\n而睦坐在椅子上，被所有人包围着。她闭着双眼，手在琴弦间来回拨动，轻声歌唱。\n此刻的她，又在想些什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "莫名的情绪笼罩在祥子的心头——\n是欣慰......还是不甘？抑或两者都有。\n现在的若叶睦，比和自己在一起时，要开心得多。\n睦就这么认真地，独自坐在椅子上，唱着熟悉的歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "如果不松开手的话——\n睦在这里找到的幸福就——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子转过身，仓皇而逃。\n就这样，消失在夜色中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
